                                                  \begin{document}$$Inhibition\ \left(\%\right)=\frac{Sr_{control}-{Sr}_{O2}}{Sr_{control}}\times 100$$\end{document}Inhibition%=Srcontrol-SrO2Srcontrol×100where
Srcontrol = Sr obtained in the control assays (0% O2)
SrO2 = Sr obtained in the assays supplemented with O2.
